"video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverImageSafeAreaTemplate not t miniLandscape ocean.png", "id": "426732919647217", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974740_426732922980550_2042688344430875991_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GwcLZGlw1_kQ7kNvwF84dZE&_nc_oc=AdpSdRQ_95AsrZC2gUPNlk3MsmUewBVZkSFXU0Q6JKEm14jlQeCxGWIzyWZgcRFvpCk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af_rS4b4P7axUbW66EHF_F2cFlSBxiZ8rbyjZwexvv-Lvw&oe=6A36925D"}, "display_name": "Ocean Passthrough", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Experience an ocean in your home!\n- over 100 hundred sea creatures and (updated) bonus level 50+ toy sized land animals/dinosaurs\n- August 2024 update: added object s position save state and custom mixed reality visual boundary to various areas and added a bonus jungle area\n- full Passthrough / Mixed Reality, Handtracking\n- move, delete, spawn animals to create your own ocean home! \n- turtles, sharks, whales, dolphins, clown fish, starfish, crocodiles, octopus, extinct dinosaur fish, piranha, and a wide variety of exotic and common sea creatures! + much more!\n-  bonus toy / table top land animals include:  rhino, elephant, t-rex, deer, crocodile, tiger, leopard, hippo, zebra, dogs, cats, various farms animals and dinosaurs, and more!\n- 10 scenes to explore, all with ability to spawn & delete fish and to move stationary fish:\n\u2014 feed swimming fish to a shark, feed fish to swimming sharks\n\u2014 swimming fish on random spawn\n\u2014 varying pre-made fish scenes\n\u2014 2 scenes full of turtles\n\u2014 empty scene to spawn fish\n\u2014 mammals only", "short_description": "Experience an ocean in your home!\n- 100+ hundred sea creatures, bonus level 50+ toy sized land animals/dinosaurs, bonus jungle \n- Passthrough, Handtracking\n- move, delete, spawn animals to create your own ocean home\n- turtles, sharks, whales, dolphins, octopus, extinct dinosaur fish, & a wide variety of exotic & com